NEW CHARACTER: The Trekkie
High intelligence, avg str, dex, con, chr, low wis.
Starting equipment: Red shirt, blessed +0 set of pointed ears, phaser (= wand
of light/fire/striking), tricoder (=stethoscope), +0 dagger, potion of
synthol(= booze/healing).

Obviously out of his league here, but...

HEW LEVEL: Enterprise level
On the level you hear stuff like "You hear a low humming from the walls"
"you feel the whole level move!"

Creatures on this level include a human named James, a human named Bones,
a elf (or vulcan) named Spock, etc....

Objects that you can get here include phasers,sensors, cloaking devices (=
cloak or displacement, cloak/ring of invis).  One (locked) room is full
of dilithium crystals, but is heavily guarded by several 'humans in red shirts'

Would be located between lvl 10-20.  No alters/Medusi/sinks/fountains/orcale/
etc stuff.  No other creatures on level.

